      "target_route": "LLVMFuzzerTestOneInput creates xinc with xmlXIncludeNewContext(doc), can register a handler on that same xinc, and then calls xmlXIncludeProcessNode(xinc, (xmlNodePtr) doc). The old route goes directly from creation to setting flags and processing.",
